--
-- TIER-SET SOURCE: 1734 item_template rows in 100 itemsets matched the D4 filter
-- (Quality 4, class 4, InventoryType <> 0, itemset <> 0, RequiredLevel 80, tier ilvls,
-- no resilience). Two guards ran on top:
--   dropped itemset 881  ( 2 pieces < 5, not a tier set): Purified Shard of the Scale
--   dropped itemset 882  ( 2 pieces < 5, not a tier set): Shiny Shard of the Flame
--   dropped itemset 902  ( 5 pieces, FL-custom entries >= 56000): Chestplate of Nak'talim
